<title>SWEDEN: AssiDoman pays 400 mln SKR for French co.</title>
<headline>AssiDoman pays 400 mln SKR for French co.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group AssiDoman said on Wednesday it paid about 400 million crowns for French family owned paper and corrugated board group, Lecoursonnois.</p>
</text>
